    <p class="content-note">Small-plan pricing splits by destination: Airalo is cheaper in Japan and on a single-GB global plan, Nomad is slightly cheaper in Europe, and the US is a tie. None of that matters much for a long stay, though, since a large Global-EX bundle undercuts both providers' standard per-GB rate once you're buying in bulk.</p>
  </div>

