    <p style="margin-top:.75rem;margin-bottom:0;color:#63553F;">Neither code here is ours. Airalo doesn't run the kind of affiliate program that supports a code like that, and most of its other codes are individual users' $3-off Airmoney referral codes rather than one official discount. Nomad's codes are found public codes too, with two tied at the same 20% rate.</p>
